### US-13 — Skapa journalpost
### Kor requesterna i ordning. IntelliJ sparar sessionscookien mellan anropen.
### Kraver ett inloggat lakarkonto (se us12-vardkontakt.http steg 1 om du saknar ett).

@host = http://localhost:8080
@user = adli.test
@pass = ANGE_DITT_LOSENORD_HAR

### 1. Logga in (form-data, inte JSON)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{user}}&password={{pass}}

### 2. Kontrollera inloggning
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### 3. HUVUDTESTET — skapa en ANTECKNING. Ska ge 201.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "note",
  "content": "Patienten klagar pa brostsmarta. Vilopuls 88."
}

> {%
    client.test("201 Created", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
    client.test("Typ ar note", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.type === "note", "Typ: " + response.body.type);
    });
    client.test("createdAt ar satt", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.createdAt !== null, "createdAt saknas");
    });
    client.global.set("journalEntryId", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Skapa en UNDERSOKNING. Ska ge 201.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "examination",
  "content": "EKG utfort, ingen ST-hojning."
}

### 5. Skapa en OPERATION. Ska ge 201.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "operation",
  "content": "Angiografi genomford utan komplikationer."
}

### 6. Hamta posten fran steg 3. Ska ge 200.
GET {{host}}/journalentry/{{journalEntryId}}

### 7. FELFALL — ogiltig typ. Ska ge 400 fran @Pattern.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "rontgen",
  "content": "Ogiltig typ"
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 8. FELFALL — vardkontakt som inte finns. Ska ge 404.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 99999,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "note",
  "content": "Finns inte"
}

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 9. FELFALL — tomt innehall. Ska ge 400 fran @NotBlank.
POST {{host}}/journalentry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "careContactId": 1,
  "createdBy": 1,
  "type": "note",
  "content": ""
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}
